#
# AArch64 exception vector table (VBAR_EL1) equivalent of the x86-64 IDT. On ARM,
# exceptions are dispatched via a fixed-layout 2KB vector table (16 entries x 128
# bytes each) pointed to by VBAR_EL1. This module provides API-compatible structures
# using the same interface as the x86-64 IDT module, mapping exception vectors to
# their ARM equivalents.
#
